The new pass-through form needs parsing before we decide whether an empty
label list means \enquote{resume the last session} or \enquote{launch only the
implicit command label}.  We therefore resolve the command argv exactly once
up front and let both the resume logic and the launch path reuse the same
result.

<<resolve command argv>>=
